  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lower Shire Rice Expansion Grant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lower Shire Cooperative is a newly formed rice marketing union comprised of five primary rice cooperatives: Muona, Mkhate, Mbwazi, Nkombedzi and Masenjere. The cooperatives came together to accumulate produce to facilitate better branded product to reach both local and international markets.</narrative>
  </description>
